        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> It may be helpful to ask \"if cmdwin didn't exist, how would we implement it?\" The answer would be the current impl, not the old one.\r\n\r\nI am not arguing about the implementation approach. It was an observation of a different behavior (which was probably not intentional) with a question about whether preserving this is wanted. If not - that's fine.",
